      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} it is not entirely the same, mine has nothing to do with a user being in an instance, leaving, and then trying to return. \n\nFor me and my friend it happens all the time when we go to an instance which is a group public and we want to invite other friends, we can´t invite them. They haven´t been in that instance before.",
