  "details": "Description\n\nSince a few updates already I cant invite friends to group public lobbies any more most of the time. When I try the button is grayed out and the message appears that the user is not part of the group. Also happens to friends they say. Also sometimes I know a friend is in one of those instances and they are on blue but instead they show up on the bottom of the friend list as if in a private lobby, which isnt the case. I always use beta;\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTry to invite friends to group public lobbies \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1897-070362ad4d-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-22_18-34-13.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_f21ad3d6-a638-4816-8be8-fa79f047bc1f/1/file)",
